WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.268
A Popkin ends. The people in it should not drift away. That is what Contacts is for.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.844
Every morning, Today leads with what matters: Grace's birthday on Saturday, what she

00:00:12.844 --> 00:00:15.739
is into, and the last thing you talked about.

00:00:15.939 --> 00:00:19.506
Beside it, what to do today, and who it has been a while since.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.134
Add someone with a name, and as much else as you know. Only you can see them.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.378
Their profile keeps it together: how to reach Chidi, your habit with him, and what

00:00:36.378 --> 00:00:37.159
he loves.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.050
Log a conversation, and anything you promised becomes a follow-up.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.403
Keep memories with them: photos, files and notes.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.627
Dates gathers every birthday and anniversary, soonest first. Follow-ups lists what

00:01:08.627 --> 00:01:10.169
you said you would do.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.654
Habits keep a rhythm: lunch with Chidi every two weeks, and a nudge when it slips.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.822
Connections draws who knows whom, family, friends and work. Groups gather people,

00:01:30.822 --> 00:01:32.849
and start a Popkin with them.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.802
And Import brings in everyone you share a Popkin with, once each. They are not told.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.343
On a phone, one column. On a desktop, the tabs become a sidebar.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.484
What the tests prove: reminders arrive at nine in the morning where you are, and

00:02:02.484 --> 00:02:04.354
nobody you add is ever told.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.987
That is journey twenty-five. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
